      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Babiloni, oruge aha nketo oshuntame omw'itaka. Enketo ogirugeho iwe Babiloni ekigo ky'Abakalidayo. Eby'okugyaho okechuma okagoijagira byahwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ojure ekihundwi aha mutwe, ohigikilire orubengo ose oburo. Ojure egauni, n'amaguru ogashemburure, orabe omu mwiga ohwage amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osigare rutondore, bakubone enjuro. Kandi ninkwehoroza, tindikusigaho muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuchunguzi waitu eibaralye aba Mukama w'amahe, n'iwe aba Mutakatifu wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oshuntame omu mwilima mara oyesize, iwe Babiloni. Aha rw'okuba tibakikweta mukama wa mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkanigalira eihanga lyange, nababona nk'abatakili bange; nabakunaga omu mikono kyonkai tiwabaganyiire. Abagurusi abo okababonesa enaku ezitali za kugambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi ebyo wakoraga tiwabitekagaho mutima anga kwijuka okwo biligira ndekelero; watekelezaga kwikara oli mukama ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu aha rw'ekyo, iwe mufakare agoijagira, otekeleze ekigambo eki iwe atakeleza oti, “Inye n'inyemalira, ow'okunshaga taliho; tindiferwa ibanye, kandi tindiferwa baana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigambo ebi byombili nibija kukubaho omu kanya kamoi, omushana gumoi: Oferwe abaana na baro eizoba likuzobagilire, olikaba omanya otai kuzinga n'okuroga!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okufakara wakwebugaga okwese: “Taliho alikumbona.” Amagezi gawe n'obumanyi bwawe byakunaga, watekeleza oti, “Inye n'inyemalira, ow'okunshaga taliho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai enaku nizija kukutera; olikaba ozinga orazinga bibure nshai. Enaku zirakutera kibandagara otazetegeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gendelera kuzinga n'okuroga nk'okwo wakamanyiire kwema oli musigazi, rundi wakwihyamu akabu otinisa ababisha bawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakutegekeire bingi byakubumbulikya. Atulikukutegekera katulebe nka barakurokora! Abo abamanya kuleba enyanyinyi n'emishusire y'eiguru, abaabona okwezi kwayema bakagamba ebirabaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibashusha ebishagate ebyokibwa omuliro. Tibyakwehungya aha muliro gutabyokya. Taliho rwo birugwamu makara muntu akota muliro anga muliro gwonene kuba nigwo ayota! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ab'otura nofafalikana nabo nibashusha ebishagate ebyo, ab'otura noyehuuba nabo kwema muli basigazi. Bona bayemalire emihanda ow'okukurokora taliho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
